  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Moon A has mass <em>M</em>, radius <em>R</em> and the gravitational field strength on the surface of Moon A is <em>g</em>. Moon B has mass 3<em>M</em> and the gravitational field strength on its surface is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g}{4}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the diameter of Moon B?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">2<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{3}\"></span><em>R</em></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">4<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{3}\"></span><em>R</em></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">12<em>R</em></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">24<em>R</em></li>\n</ol>"
